  "notes": "Rim cliff kit (art/env_rim/cliffs.py). Each piece is a node rim_cliff_w*/rim_spire_*; origin at the base of the face, centre of its width; the face looks toward +Z, +Y up, -Z goes into the hill. Shared atlas: basecolor (with long AO), ORM (AO, roughness, curvature 0.5 = flat; glTF reads B as metallic: ignore it), tangent-space normal (MikkTSpace: the game computes tangents at load, three/addons/libs/mikktspace). Collision proxy per piece: col_<name> (material 'collider', hide it). rim_talus_*: scree fans, apex at the wall (origin), spreading toward +Z."
